#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:5 b74db950d7b044e6804acc798f85a951
msgid "Auto Mode"
msgstr "Auto 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:7 fb06480b99004ca78ed1b08033375fee
msgid ""
"In Auto mode the vehicle will follow a pre-programmed mission stored in the "
"autopilot which is made up of navigation commands (i.e. waypoints) and “do” "
"commands (i.e. commands that do not affect the location of the vehicle "
"including triggering a camera shutter)."
msgstr ""
"在 Auto "
"模式下，车辆将执行存储在自动驾驶仪中的预编程任务，该任务由导航命令（即航点）和「执行」命令（即不影响车辆位置的命令，例如触发相机快门）组成。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:9 859bf496c9a8422099e70e90f9c4d806
msgid ""
"This mode requires the vehicle have :ref:`GPS <common-positioning-landing-"
"page>` and/or :ref:`visual odometry <common-zed>` or :ref:`wheel encoders "
"<wheel-encoder>`."
msgstr ""
"此模式要求车辆具备 :ref:`GPS <common-positioning-landing-page>` 和/或 :ref:`视觉里程计 "
"<common-zed>` 或 :ref:`车轮编码器 <wheel-encoder>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:12 a01b1b664c39461fb58fdf47c1b32cc0
msgid "Creating a Mission"
msgstr "创建任务"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:14 07181fb9a6e04e97a4ce67c565d1073b
msgid ""
"Most ground stations are capable of creating and uploading missions.  "
"Mission Planner allows this using the Flight Planner screen:"
msgstr "大多数地面站都能创建和上传任务。Mission Planner 可通过飞行规划界面执行此操作："

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:16 698e6738b1a94f689010bb6d69066b05
msgid "connect your autopilot to your PC using a USB cable or telemetry"
msgstr "使用 USB 线缆或数传将自动驾驶仪连接到电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:17 375594dd40564ab0894830e3471ef09b
msgid "open the Mission Planner on your PC and press the Connect button"
msgstr "在电脑上打开 Mission Planner 并点击连接按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:18 a29059dc5da6465eb8c671590ad5209b
msgid ""
"go to the Flight Planer screen and click on the map in a few places to add "
"waypoints"
msgstr "进入飞行规划界面，在地图上点击几处以添加航点"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:19 02473bba44df4899bbb60fe365ec2118
msgid ""
"in the command list section, click once on the last waypoint command in the "
"list and press the \"Add Below\" button, a new command WAYPOINT command "
"should appear at the bottom of the list"
msgstr "在命令列表区域，单击列表中最后一个航点命令，然后点击「Add Below」按钮，列表底部将出现一个新的 WAYPOINT 命令"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:20 c8bbd344fb064c18a0245d8c2e4dd450
msgid "click on the word WAYPOINT and change the command to \"RETURN_TO_LAUNCH\""
msgstr "点击「WAYPOINT」字样，将命令更改为「RETURN_TO_LAUNCH」"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:21 2fe16d7c91c24b68acbd57f73308d165
msgid "upload the mission to the autopilot using the \"Write WPs\" button."
msgstr "使用「Write WPs」按钮将任务上传至自动驾驶仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:27 9476dc4843f14b0893e2e2ca935a3f70
msgid "Starting the Mission"
msgstr "启动任务"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:29 939e47e691af49f1b53faaf0476b6265
msgid "The following instructions should be followed to start the mission:"
msgstr "按照以下步骤启动任务："

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:31 9ceaa290447d44c582b22e8439299723
msgid ""
"setup the :ref:`transmitter mode switch <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-"
"configuration>` so that Auto can be selected"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`遥控器模式开关 <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>`，使其能够选择 "
"Auto 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:32 d6d49fac274545b393f2a052de3565ad
msgid ""
"take the vehicle outside, power it on and wait for a good position estimate "
"(LED will turn green)"
msgstr "将车辆带到室外，开机后等待获得良好的位置估计（LED 将变为绿色）"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:33 5d1a8a08a5aa43dd9604091f3a37653e
msgid ""
"arm the vehicle in :ref:`MANUAL <manual-mode>` or :ref:`HOLD <hold-mode>`"
msgstr "在 :ref:`MANUAL <manual-mode>` 或 :ref:`HOLD <hold-mode>` 模式下解锁车辆"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:34 d68584637d684fda86d2a666fc9aceeb
msgid ""
"change the mode to AUTO and the vehicle should begin executing the commands "
"one after another"
msgstr "切换至 AUTO 模式，车辆应开始依次执行各项命令"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:35 b63ad9e2ca964343a9d7e33271b43aca
msgid ""
"if telemetry is connected you should see the vehicle travelling around the "
"course"
msgstr "若已连接数传，应能看到车辆沿航线行驶"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:36 312b059f5245451ab0f0c8dcfc2162f4
msgid ""
"if you notice any odd behaviour, use the transmitter's mode switch at any "
"time to change back to :ref:`MANUAL <manual-mode>` or :ref:`HOLD <hold-"
"mode>`"
msgstr ""
"若发现任何异常行为，可随时使用遥控器模式开关切换回 :ref:`MANUAL <manual-mode>` 或 :ref:`HOLD <hold-"
"mode>` 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:37 3adeeb5ae61b492491590718dc81d635
msgid ""
"if all goes well the vehicle will travel the course and then return to the "
"point where it was armed (assuming the final command was Return-To-Launch)"
msgstr "若一切顺利，车辆将完成航线行驶，然后返回解锁点（假设最后一条命令为返航）"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:40 df23e03ae6864b459e7a58acb3b60ff9
msgid "Starting the Mission with a Kick"
msgstr "通过推动启动任务"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:42 9e685cd3771240b7a2cf31cf5f96b87e
msgid ""
"The mission normally starts the moment the vehicle is switched into Auto "
"mode but alternatively it can be configured to wait for an push by setting "
"the :ref:`AUTO_KICKSTART <AUTO_KICKSTART>` parameter to an acceleration in "
"m/s/s.  A value of 2 m/s/s will normally work."
msgstr ""
"任务通常在车辆切换至 Auto 模式时立即启动，但也可通过将 :ref:`AUTO_KICKSTART <AUTO_KICKSTART>` "
"参数设置为一个加速度值（单位：m/s/s）来配置为等待推动后再启动。通常设置为 2 m/s/s 即可正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:45 bad07c86162348fcbefb3073e7eb3990
msgid "Starting the Mission from a button"
msgstr "通过按钮启动任务"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:47 6115cf353d024849a68c9c10c6b94b25
msgid ""
"The mission can be started from a switch as described on the "
":ref:`Start/Stop switch <startstop-switch>` page."
msgstr "任务可以通过开关启动，具体说明请参见 :ref:`启动/停止开关 <startstop-switch>` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:50 345359e19b164391afe980dd31f4bacc
msgid "Speed Nudging"
msgstr "速度微调"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:52 66c2495142be47388e6adc0994ff6f2f
msgid ""
"While the vehicle is executing a mission, the user can increase the "
"vehicle's speed by raising the transmitter's throttle stick to between 75% "
"and 100%.  At 75% the vehicle will remain at it's configured speed (i.e. "
":ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>`), this linearly increases to the vehicle's "
"maximum speed as the pilot's throttle stick reaches 100%."
msgstr ""
"在车辆执行任务期间，用户可以通过将遥控器油门摇杆推至 75% 至 100% 之间来提升车速。当油门摇杆位于 75% 时，车辆将保持其配置速度（即 "
":ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>`），随着油门摇杆推至 100%，速度线性增加至车辆最大速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:55 0f3ec78a7e024ce8af1399b894adc2d8
msgid "Mission End"
msgstr "任务结束"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:57 d4cab67d0a4d46189e053f0e269a86f2
msgid ""
"If a mission ends on a waypoint, then it will switch to a mode determined by"
" the :ref:`MIS_DONE_BEHAVE<MIS_DONE_BEHAVE>` parameter. It can be changed "
"from this mode either by the RC mode switch changing, or via ground control "
"station."
msgstr ""
"若任务在航点处结束，将切换到由 :ref:`MIS_DONE_BEHAVE<MIS_DONE_BEHAVE>` 参数决定的模式。可通过 RC "
"模式开关或地面站来改变此模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:60 e93a8aa16ae048d2b41973bbfc041999
msgid "Resuming or Restarting a Mission"
msgstr "恢复或重启任务"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:62 74e80fd14e6041bbbf88816905b547c0
msgid ""
"If a mission is interrupted (for example if the user switches the vehicle "
"out of Auto mode before it has completed the mission) the last command "
"executed is stored and when the vehicle is next returned to Auto mode it "
"will resume the mission from this command.  Note: disarming the vehicle or "
"rebooting the autopilot will reset the mission back to the first command."
msgstr ""
"若任务被中断（例如用户在任务完成前将车辆切换出 Auto 模式），最后执行的命令将被保存，当车辆下次返回 Auto "
"模式时将从此命令处恢复任务。注意：对车辆上锁或重启自动驾驶仪将使任务重置回第一条命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:64 35647cb04f824d67b189046351a440b7
msgid ""
"If you would prefer the mission was always restarted from the beginning, set"
" the :ref:`MIS_RESTART <MIS_RESTART>` parameter to \"1\"."
msgstr "若希望任务始终从头开始，请将 :ref:`MIS_RESTART <MIS_RESTART>` 参数设置为「1」。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:67 c977178df1fd42a8be39f3a55b27331c
msgid "Setting the active command"
msgstr "设置当前执行命令"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:69 ca0359cc005342d4826c1d3e080db00a
msgid ""
"While the vehicle is executing a mission in Auto, the active command can be "
"changed from the ground station.  If using Mission Planner this is done from"
" the Flight Data >> Actions tab's \"Set WP\" button."
msgstr ""
"在车辆执行 Auto 任务期间，可从地面站更改当前执行命令。若使用 Mission Planner，请在飞行数据 >> 操作选项卡的「Set "
"WP」按钮处操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:75 35e79377e86f44c48aff861fc49f2ef7
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "调参"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:77 72a550399a6a4fb184a985ba4e1a9e81
msgid ""
"Details on how to tune the controllers for good waypoint control can be "
"found on the :ref:`Tuning Navigation <rover-tuning-navigation>` page."
msgstr "有关如何调整控制器以实现良好航点控制的详细信息，请参见 :ref:`导航调参 <rover-tuning-navigation>` 页面。"
